# frontend/.dockerignore
#
# Purpose: Excludes host dependencies, Next.js build outputs, secrets, and test artifacts
# from the frontend Docker build context.
#
# Context: Prevents Windows/macOS pnpm node_modules symlinks and local .env.local files
# from overwriting Linux Alpine container layers during COPY . . in the builder stage.
#
# Implementation Specs: Retains package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, pnpm-workspace.yaml, public/,
# and src/ while ignoring node_modules, .next, out, coverage, Playwright/test outputs, and .env files.

node_modules
.next
out
build
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
blob-report
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo
*.zip
tests
README.md
LICENSE
